  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Some believe that to know your potential foe is to have won before the battle begins.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Tatulani subtype.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You gain a +2 bonus to Linguistics checks. Every rank of Linguistics gives two languages instead of one. You immediately gain one language per rank of linguistics you had before gaining this feat.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/racial-feats#toc23\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
